        "id": "filter-first",
        "says": "Cheap filters go before expensive maps, so the expensive work runs only on the elements that survive.",
        "basis": [
          "example:16-streams-api/README_4.4.3.md:2",
          "example:16-streams-api/README_4.4.3.md:3",
          "example:16-streams-api/README_4.4.3.md:11"
        ],
        "exercise": null,
        "reason": "both orders return the same elements, so the saving is a claim about cost that no test of the result can observe"
      },
      {
        "id": "flat-map",
